      "level": "进阶",
      "subtopic": "JA4 TLS 客户端指纹",
      "knowledgePoint": "忽略GREASE",
      "questionType": "概念与原理",
      "origin": "自行整理",
      "question": "计算 JA4 时如何处理 ClientHello 中的 GREASE 值？",
      "answer": "忽略这些值，不把它们计入相关数量或哈希输入。",
      "explanation": "GREASE 是为协议扩展兼容性设计的保留值。",
      "example": "不同 GREASE 值不应单独改变该指纹的相关部分。",
      "tags": [
        "JA4 TLS 客户端指纹",
        "忽略GREASE"
      ],
      "evidence": "source",
      "reference": "https://github.com/FoxIO-LLC/ja4/blob/820ec301a930ae3d92a80afd8fc4d3f1abb73b9d/technical_details/JA4.md"
